WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.437
One. The silence.

2
00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:05.617
Two. The fire.

3
00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:10.159
Three. A million parts… rising as one.

4
00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:12.773
Four. Letting go.

5
00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.086
Five. The sky turns black…

6
00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:19.172
Six. …and the Earth turns blue.

7
00:00:19.633 --> 00:00:23.054
Seven. Wings… open to the Sun.

8
00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:26.395
Eight. A new eye on our world.

9
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.357
Nine. Built by your hands.

10
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.144
Ten. Welcome to First Light.
